    "created_at": "2020-06-11T00:17:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-11T00:17:05Z",
    "body": "Chrome considers `01/mm/yyyy` invalid with this validation message: \"Please enter a valid value. The field is incomplete or has an invalid date.\"\r\nIt makes sense that `input.value` doesn't change in this situation since the date isn't completely filled out yet.\r\nFirefox doesn't seem to have this behavior, but it does seem like web developers are interested in knowing when the date is partially filled out vs actually empty.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
