    "created_at": "2021-01-14T19:22:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-14T19:22:55Z",
    "body": "For a different use, in some cases validity can only be checked asynchronously (e.g. whether a login is unique, a password has not been leaked, or a tax identifier is registered). In a callback from such a check validity can be updated using `setCustomValidity()`. Some other module may wish to react to the change (for instance a snippet disabling submit buttons until a form is valid), so a \"validitychange\" event could be convenient.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
